  <main>

```
<p class="intro">
  Creating opportunities through community.
</p>

<p>
  What makes Malta special? Perhaps it's the people, the traditions, the stories,
  and the places only locals know. Could sharing something you already do also earn
  you a little extra?
</p>

<p>
  What do you enjoy? Do you have a garden café? A classic car? A fishing boat?
  Is your grandma the best cook? Do you know local history or Malta's beautiful
  stone buildings? The perfect sunset? A hidden snorkeling spot? Would you enjoy
  welcoming visitors at the airport? Maybe yoga, hiking, horses? Family traditions?
  Or... something nobody has thought of yet.
</p>

<p>
  Everyone belongs, contributes and benefits. Want to help build something new?
  This is just the beginning, just sharing ideas. The goal is creating
  friendships, opportunities, and experiences that benefit everyone.
</p>

<p>
  We hope visitors will experience Malta through the people who live here,
  creating memories they'll take home. We believe tourism should leave communities
  stronger than it found them.
</p>

<p>
  The best ideas often begin with "what if?" We'd love to hear from you.
  Every message will be read. Every idea will be considered.
  This may take time, but every community starts with one conversation—perhaps yours.
</p>

<img
  src="/SIGNATURE-THICK-NAVY-CLEAR.png"
  alt="Carmela's signature"
  class="signature"
/>

<p class="email">
  <a href="mailto:contact@ourmalta.org">
    contact@ourmalta.org
  </a>
</p>
